18806-the-official-werewolf-heart-of-the-forest-thread-was-found-this-game-on-steam?p=1420385#post1420385\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why is it not reassuring? This is arguably the best thing ever made for Werewolf not based around Pentex.</div> </div> </div> </div>THIS is the best thing ever made for Werewolf?<br /> <br /> BWAHAHAHAHAHAHAH! Bro! What're you talking about?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Don't get me wrong, its good (<i>as a Visual Novel can get</i>)- but this is a crazy thing to say.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 10-27-2020, 08:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T06:03:43-07:00","id":1420440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1171889/6062425-25-years-special-werewolf-the-apocalypse-heart-of-the-forest\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/rails/active_storage/representations/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MTcwMDIyNDEsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--c242d5bddad60e25180d218fde8dd77773407520/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6eyJmb3JtYXQiOiJqcGciLCJyZXNpemVfdG9fZmlsbCI6WzI1MCwyNTAseyJjcm9wIjoiY2VudHJlIn1dLCJzYXZlciI6eyJxdWFsaXR5Ijo2MH0sImNvbG91cnNwYWNlIjoic3JnYiJ9LCJwdXIiOiJ2YXJpYXRpb24ifX0=--21f3793904e6ce1806a5a794a691217fceef82c7/25yrsLogoBlackAcceptable.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1171889/6062425-25-years-special-werewolf-the-apocalypse-heart-of-the-forest\" target=\"_blank\"> 25 Years Special - Werewolf: the Apocalypse - Heart of the Forest - 25 Years of Vampire: The Masquerade </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/1171889/6062425-25-years-special-werewolf-the-apocalypse-heart-of-the-forest\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.buzzsprout.com/1171889/6062425-25-years-special-werewolf-the-apocalypse-heart-of-the-forest </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Hey, folks please join Bob and Nick as they review Werewolf: the Apocalypse - Heart of the Forest. Give it a listen and if you played the game please reach out and tell us what you think!Genre: Visual Novel, Adventure, RPGDeveloper:Different Tales... </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Here's 25 Years of Vampire: The Masquerade's review. Bob is really coming into his own as the host and with a new cast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T06:06:54-07:00","id":1420442,"title":"","content":"I don't understand you guys. CTPhipps just said that he thinks HotF is the best thing, not based around Pentex. Outside of TTRPG stuff and novels, there was little to none types of media presenting WTA. By omission, he's right. Until we get a movie, a TV show, or another videogame that won't be based around Pentex [like Earthbound] HotF is arguably the best thing.<br /> <br /> also, Fera or bust for W5","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Constantinople was <b>not</b> a mistake.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26438-thedreamapologist","name":"TheDreamApologist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T06:21:22-07:00","id":1420446,"title":"","content":"I am a decent werewolf fan and it actually influenced some of my writing (I wrote some weredeer urban fantasy). I love the Umbra, tribes, and all the other wonderful things that make W:TA fine but I do think it's a game that has never had its really amazing qualities explored by a supplement. Perhaps I've overstating that I think THIS game (more so than Earthblood) will be the thing that leads people to love W:TA the way Bloodlines did V:TM but I really just loved how &quot;real&quot; and &quot;relevant&quot; this visual novel was. The art style just blew me away as well.<br /> <br /> For me, it gets right to the heart of the Garou experience.<br /> <br /> My only regret is it seems to end right as you are getting interesting. I wish this had been twice or even three times as long.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T06:25:09-07:00","id":1420448,"title":"","content":"He said it as an objective fact and that's debatable. Also WtA is a tabletop game, so its primary fiat is IN TTRPG material. It's represented within its own line so I don't see how this mere Visual Novel tops all the stuff we've seen from WtA. The game isn't defined by &quot;movies, TV shows, or video-games,&quot; this logic is just nonsense. Pentex was never even the primary best part of in my OPINION (key word opinion and not a declaration of being objective &quot;fact&quot;) of WtA, it was the Umbra and the Triat. Pentex is only a small part in the scheme of things in the first place.<br /> <br /> On this novel itself- you can't even choose make your own character, I don't even know if you fight Banes (which is a HUGE part of the game), can you even side-step in this, and from what I hear so far its merely a soapy game at large- far from what WtA is sheeted on. So its VERY funny to call this the &quot;best thing of Werewolf&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-27T06:30:55-07:00","id":1420451,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1418806-the-official-werewolf-heart-of-the-forest-thread-was-found-this-game-on-steam?p=1420448#post1420448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He said it as an objective fact and that's debatable. Also WtA is a tabletop game, so its primary fiat is IN TTRPG material. It's represented within its own line so I don't see how this mere Visual Novel tops all the stuff we've seen from WtA. The game isn't defined by &quot;movies, TV shows, or video-games,&quot; this logic is just nonsense. Pentex was never even the primary best part of in my OPINION (key word opinion and not a declaration of being objective &quot;fact&quot;) of WtA, it was the Umbra and the Triat. Pentex is only a small part in the scheme of things in the first place.<br /> <br /> <b>On this novel itself- you can't even choose make your own character, I don't even know if you fight Banes (which is a HUGE part of the game), can you even side-step in this, and from what I hear so far its merely a soapy game at large- far from what WtA is sheeted on. So its VERY funny to call this the &quot;best thing of Werewolf&quot;.</b></div> </div> </div> </div>I feel like you should probably play it before you make a values judgement on it. The visual novel basically amounts to being a Lost Cub's Rite of Passage and how they must deal with their ancestry as well as stopping the destruction of a forest that is an ancient powerful spirit falling to the Wyrm. There's numerous Bane fights in your vision quest but they aren't important because you tear through them.<br /> <br /> The bigger issue is stopping the logging company that is possibly Pentex, possibly not.<br /> <br /> Maya is notably also a blank slate for you to make into a Rage-filled monster or a Philodox or Ragabash or whatever. Her characteristics are determined by your choices.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-27-2020, 09:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/a