o, but bought the full version recently. From the demo it was a fine game within the genre of an interactive story. I wouldn't have minded a thoughtful German translation nor a full audio in English or German. But that is from a computer games standpoint. From a roleplaying standpoint and a werewolf standpoint it was very nice. It is comparable to how I would roleplay an introduction with a single player, especially one who never played WtA before.<br /> <br /> Doesn't mean I like the games implications for W5...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}